    <string name="settings_censorship_description">How the app reaches your account servers. Each method you leave on is tried in turn; at least one must stay on.</string>
    <string name="settings_censorship_directip_hint">Connect by IP address, skipping DNS entirely. The only method that works with the kill switch locked.</string>
    <string name="settings_censorship_directip_title">Direct IP</string>
    <string name="settings_censorship_fronted_hint">Reach your account through a relay on a large content network, whose address is shared with much of the web and cannot be blocked cheaply. The relay only passes along sealed data it cannot read.</string>
